{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "ornitech-pipeline-debug-v1",
    "name": "OrniTech 3D Builder — Full Pipeline Debug",
    "description": "# Full Website Generation Pipeline Debug Collection\n\nThis collection traces every stage of the OrniTech 3D Website Builder backend pipeline from **user registration** through **ZIP download**.\n\n## Execution Order\n1. Register User\n2. Login (saves JWT)\n3. Get Profile\n4. Check Credits\n5. Create Project (saves projectId, triggers worker)\n6. List Projects\n7. Get Project Details\n8. Poll Project Status (loop until COMPLETED/FAILED)\n9. Download ZIP\n\n## How to Run\n1. Import this collection\n2. Import the environment file\n3. Select the **OrniTech 3D Builder — Pipeline Debug** environment\n4. Click **Run Collection** → Runner will execute all steps sequentially\n5. For step 8 (Poll), use **Send and Retry** or run manually until COMPLETED\n\n## Environment Variables (auto-populated)\n- `jwt` — Bearer token\n- `userId` — Authenticated user ObjectId\n- `projectId` — Created project ObjectId\n- `zipPath` — Final ZIP file path\n- `lastProgress` / `lastStatus` — Polling state tracker",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Register User",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"{{userName}}\",\n  \"email\": \"{{userEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{userPassword}}\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/signup",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["api", "auth", "signup"]
        },
        "description": "## Register a new user\n\n**Method:** POST  \n**URL:** `{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/signup`  \n**Auth:** None  \n\n**Body:**\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"Pipeline Debugger\",\n  \"email\": \"pipeline-debug@ornitech.test\",\n  \"password\": \"Debug@12345\"\n}\n```\n\n**Expected Status:** 201  \n**Expected Response:**\n```json\n{\n  \"message\": \"Account created successfully!\",\n  \"token\": \"eyJhbG...\",\n  \"user\": {\n    \"id\": \"...\",\n    \"name\": \"Pipeline Debugger\",\n    \"email\": \"pipeline-debug@ornitech.test\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\nIf user already exists, the login step will still work."
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "// ─── Register User Tests ───",
              "",
              "const res = pm.response.json();",
              "",
              "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
              "    pm.test('✅ Registration successful (201)', () => {",
              "        pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
              "    });",
              "",
              "    pm.test('✅ JWT token returned', () => {",
              "        pm.expect(res.token).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty;",
              "    });",
              "",
              "    pm.test('✅ User object returned', () => {",
              "        pm.expect(res.user).to.have.property('id');",
              "        pm.expect(res.user).to.have.property('name');",
              "        pm.expect(res.user).to.have.property('email');",
              "    });",
              "",
              "    // Save JWT and userId",
              "    pm.environment.set('jwt', res.token);",
              "    pm.environment.set('userId', res.user.id);",
              "",
              "    console.log('━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━');",
              "    console.log('🟢 REGISTRATION COMPLETE');",
              "    console.log('  User ID:  ' + res.user.id);",
              "    console.log('  Name:     ' + res.user.name);",
              "    console.log('  Email:    ' + res.user.email);",
              "    console.log('  JWT:      ' + res.token.substring(0, 30) + '...');",
              "    console.log('━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━');",
              "} else if (pm.response.code === 400) {",
              "    pm.test('ℹ️ User already exists — will login next', () => {",
              "        pm.expect(res.message).to.include('already');",
              "    });",
              "    console.log('ℹ️ User already registered, proceeding to login...');",
              "} else {",
              "    pm.test('❌ Unexpected status: ' + pm.response.code, () => {",
              "        pm.expect.fail('Expected 201 or 400, got ' + pm.response.code);",
              "    });",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "response": []
    },
    {
